    (
        "import { StyleSheetManager } from 'styled-components';\nexport const App = () => (\n  <StyleSheetManager stylisPlugins={[rtl]} shouldForwardProp={valid}>x</StyleSheetManager>\n);",
        "App.tsx:3:22: `stylisPlugins` of `StyleSheetManager` from `styled-components` runs stylis plugins over the CSS at runtime, which Devup UI does not compile, so the plugins would never reach the stylesheet. Fix: write the CSS the plugins would produce into the styles, or set `importAliases: { 'styled-components': false }` and build with styled-components\nApp.tsx:3:44: `shouldForwardProp` of `StyleSheetManager` from `styled-components` filters at runtime the props every styled component passes on, which Devup UI does not compile, so no prop would be filtered by it. Fix: pass `shouldForwardProp` to `.withConfig()` of each styled component, or set `importAliases: { 'styled-components': false }` and build with styled-components",
